  "role": "Executive Director",
  "incoming": true,
  "bio": "V. Srinivasa Rangan has served as Executive Director of HDFC Bank Ltd. since 23 November 2023, after a tenure as Executive Director and Chief Financial Officer of e‑HDFC. He joined the HDFC Group in 1986, was inducted onto the board as Executive Director in January 2010, and holds a Bachelor’s degree in Commerce from the University of Delhi and is a qualified Associate of the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India."
 },
 "bio:https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6df1f05c-9926-47ce-9896-94c41bdb71ab.pdf": {
  "name": "V. Srinivasa Rangan",
  "role": "Executive Director",
  "incoming": true,
  "bio": "V. Srinivasa Rangan has served as Executive Director of HDFC Bank Ltd. since November 2023, after a 13‑year tenure as Executive Director and Chief Financial Officer of the former Housing Development Finance Corporation (e‑HDFC). He joined the HDFC Group in 1986, became Executive Director in 2010, and holds a B.Com from the University of Delhi and is a qualified Chartered Accountant (ICAI)."
 },
 "bio:https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b36ff756-1cf7-44a3-9b2c-4583e7e0e792.pdf": {
  "name": "Mr. Sanjay D’Souza",
  "role": "Group Head, Business Banking",
  "incoming": false,
  "bio": "Mr. Sanjay D’Souza is the Group Head of Business Banking, Emerging Enterprises and Micro Enterprises at HDFC Bank, a role he has held since 2023 after joining the bank in 1999. He has over 33 years of banking experience, primarily in credit and MSME business, and holds a B.Sc. in Mechanical Engineering and an MMS in Finance."
 },
